---
import IndexPage from "../layouts/IndexPage.astro";
import BodyLink from "../components/BodyLink.astro";
import ContactEmailCispa from "../components/ContactEmailCispa.astro";
---

<IndexPage>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">Howdy!</h1>
  <p>
    I am a Master's student at <BodyLink
      href="https://www.uni-saarland.de/start.html"
      >Saarland University</BodyLink
    > under the support of <BodyLink
      href="https://cispa.de/en/career/excellence-program"
      >CISPA's Excellence Program for Master's Students</BodyLink
    > co-advised by <BodyLink href="https://wouterlueks.nl/"
      >Wouter Lueks</BodyLink
    > and <BodyLink href="https://ssasy.github.io/">Sajin Sasy</BodyLink>. I
    plan to stay at CISPA to pursue a PhD.
  </p><p>
    I seek to develop practical solutions to problems that require better
    security and privacy guarantees where existing solutions do not suffice.
  </p><p>
    Feel free to reach out if you'd like to collaborate or connect! You can
    reach me via email at <ContactEmailCispa />.
  </p>
</IndexPage>
